---
flowchart LR
    R1["Evaluate every candidate on the<br/>same development cases"]:::csMuted
    R2["Build hard-gated vectors of<br/>per-case outcomes"]:::csInfo
    R3["Preserve the non-dominated<br/>Pareto archive"]:::csAccent
    R4["Reflect on weak cases; create<br/>lineage-bound children"]:::csSpecial
    R5["Freeze one robust archive member;<br/>baseline-versus-candidate holdout"]:::csSuccess
    R1 --> R2 --> R3 --> R4 --> R5
    R4 -.->|next generation| R1
  classDef csAccent fill:#e7e7e7,stroke:#4f4f4f,color:#333e48,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef csMuted fill:#e7e7e7,stroke:#828282,color:#333e48,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef csSuccess fill:#cfcfcf,stroke:#333e48,color:#333e48,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef csInfo fill:#ffccd5,stroke:#9e1b32,color:#333e48,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef csSpecial fill:#e7e7e7,stroke:#696969,color:#333e48,stroke-width:2px;
